Since Dragons are essentially the most dangerous animal in the game, and in
fact the _only_ thing that is really capable of killing a really strong
character who is resistant to poison, it seems like it is too easy to get rid
of them for good.

Suggestion: Make it impossible to wipe out all dragons with a single genocide.
Either ask for a kind of dragon, or pick one randomly.  Possibly replace the
"You have wiped out all 'D's" with "You have wiped out <a few/some/most/almost
all/all 'D's" depending on how many have been genocided.

I think that I prefer the "random" option, to keep people from wiping out the
"hard" kinds and keeping the "easy" ones to eat...


